OL,3,GNEWSAUnderage drinking at club 'not an
OL,4,Aisolated incident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlleged underage drinking at a
OL,7,Fnightclub was "not an isolated
OL,8,Fincident", a public health officer has
OL,9,Fargued.
OL,11,FMiddlesbrough Council's licensing
OL,12,Fcommittee is reviewing The Lounge
OL,13,FAfrique on Corporation Road after its
OL,14,Flicence was suspended last month.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
