OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUnderage drinking at club 'not an
OL,4,Aisolated incident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCleveland Police said underage girls
OL,7,Fwere served drinks before one was
OL,8,Fallegedly raped. The council's
OL,9,Fprincipal public protection officer
OL,10,Fsaid there was a "pattern of concerns",
OL,11,Fincluding a room containing two double
OL,12,Fbeds, which the licence holder Percy
OL,13,FQuarcoo said was used for sleeping.
OL,15,FQuarcoo said he was bringing in new
OL,16,Fmeasures, including a new security
OL,17,Fteam, a safeguarding lead and
OL,18,Fstrengthened age verification.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
